### 35) 在数据库里挑一条缺勤记录（手动在 MySQL 中执行）
#   SELECT absence_id, student_id, offering_id, course_date, section_start, section_end, status
#   FROM absence
#   ORDER BY absence_id;
#
# 前提：至少有一条 status = 'PENDING_MAKEUP' 的缺勤记录。
# 下文假设：absence_id = 1, student_id = 2, offering_id = 1, course_date = 2024-10-15, section 1-2
# 若不一致，请改成你实际查到的 absenceId / studentId。

### 36) 将缺勤 #1 转成一张新的请假单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/absences/3/convert-to-leave
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

{
  "studentId": 2,
  "termId": 1,
  "leaveType": "AFFAIR",
  "reason": "事后补假：老师已同意，请录入系统",
  "proofUrl": null,
  "startTime": "2024-10-15T08:00:00",
  "endTime": "2024-10-15T18:00:00"
}

<> 2025-12-24T202737.500.json


